  "body": "Offering a refined blend of modern design, versatile living and coastal charm, this architecturally designed residence is an exceptional opportunity in one of the Eastern Beaches' most desirable locations.\r\nSet on a standalone corner site, the home enjoys panoramic views and a thoughtfully planned layout across approximately 181sqm of floor area on approximately 241sqm of land.\r\nWith Title and CCC already issued, buyers can move forward with confidence and enjoy the benefits of a newly completed, contemporary home.\r\nKey Features\r\n•5 spacious bedrooms with a flexible layout for modern family living\r\n•Ground-floor bedroom with ensuite and separate private entry - ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers or potential rental use\r\n•Open-plan living and dining designed for easy everyday living and entertaining\r\n•Contemporary designer kitchen with a stylish, functional layout\r\n•Master suite with sea views, walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n•Additional upstairs family lounge, providing a second living zone\r\n•Single internal-access garage with EV charger ready\r\n•Double glazing for year-round comfort and energy efficiency\r\n•Heat pump for efficient heating and cooling\r\n•Integrated sound system for effortless entertainment\r\n•Comprehensive security system\r\n•Standalone corner position with additional off-street parking\r\n•Beautiful sea views adding a special coastal touch to everyday living\r\nExceptional Schooling & Lifestyle\r\nEducation is a major highlight, with the property zoned for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, both within walking distance.\r\nBeyond the school zone, enjoy a fantastic coastal lifestyle with everyday conveniences close at hand:\r\n•Beach - approximately 5 minutes' walk\r\n•Highland Park Shopping Centre\r\n•Half Moon Bay Marina and ferry service to the CBD\r\n•Howick Golf Club\r\n•Local shops, cafés, transport and other amenities\r\nYour Coastal Lifestyle Starts Here\r\nCombining architectural design, flexible family living and highly sought-after school zoning, this stylish five-bedroom residence offers an outstanding opportunity for families, investors or those seeking a quality coastal lifestyle.\r\nMove-in ready, beautifully designed and perfectly positioned - this is a home that deserves to be viewed.\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
